{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338193-limits-of-shaping","id":1338193,"title":"Limits of Shaping","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-27T15:05:11-07:00","id":1338193,"title":"Limits of Shaping","content":"I would like to know how community views limits on Shaping spell. Is is possible to &quot;defy gravity&quot; with second Reach option, making solids &quot;flow&quot; by constantly Shaping them upwards? It is possible to create complex devices by Shaping their existing parts into whole with Wits + Crafts roll? Can you assemble a gun, a car, a personal computer or smartphone, if you have raw materials and template in your mind?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T15:09:03-07:00","id":1338194,"title":"","content":"This is going to vary hugely table-by-table, but I allow everything you mentioned at mine, as does the ST when I'm a player.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T15:16:46-07:00","id":1338200,"title":"","content":"I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3570_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3570\" data-vbnamecard=\"3570\">lnodiv</a>, everything mentioned is within the purview of Shaping. The one caveat is that in my interpretation Shaping does not allow full telekinesis, in order to &quot;defy gravity&quot; with something that does not naturally float it must still be connected to something appropriately supported; e.g. you could make steal spires from a steal beam, but could not levitate the beam itself or support the spires if you disconnected them from the beam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T19:53:37-07:00","id":1338225,"title":"","content":"Using Shaping would compensate the lack of necessary tools, but I require the same exact crafting rolls as if no Magic was involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12673-ew-matias","name":"EW-Matias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T02:56:20-07:00","id":1338245,"title":"